DESCRIPTION:Join Us to Get the Latest Insights at WSAVA 2026 Let’s impro
 ve small animal health together! Our global community of veterinary profes
 sionals is coming together for the 51st World Small Animal Veterinary Asso
 ciation Congress (WSAVA 2026)\, which will take place from 13-15 October 2
 026\, in Warsaw\, Poland. Prepare for three days full of updates and clini
 cal tips to improve your practice\, networking opportunities to meet colle
 agues from all over the world\, sharing perspectives\, and\, of course\, h
 aving fun! Meet us at the crossroads of tradition and innovation\, Warsaw.
